system requirment
	1.	OS Linux ( REDHAT 8.0 )
	2.	Perl 
	3.	mysql-server
	4.	root account 	

pre-install
	
	1.	copy "words" into /usr/dict/words  
	2.	install DBI,Showtable and MySQL DBD module you can read instruction from http://home.ubalt.edu/abento/452/dbi 
	3.	import cve database into mysql-server database 
		by 	copy "cve" into "/tmp/cve.txt"	
		and	copy "candidate.txt" into "/tmp/candidate.txt"
		
	 	open program mysql and type this follow 
		1.	create database cve;
		2.	use cve;
		3.	create table cve (id int,name text,description text,reference text);
		4.	load data in file "/tmp/cve.txt" into table cve 
			fields terminated by '"'
			enclosed by '}'
			line terminated by '\n';
		5.	create table candidate (id int,name text,description text,phase text,reference text,vote text,comment text);
		6.	load data infile "/tmp/candidate.txt" into table candidate
			fields terminated by '}'
			lines terminated by '\n';  	
		
	4.	copy file "sss" to sub directory "sss/" example  "../sss/sss" and 
			chmod 755 sss  

run program 
	
	1.	type ./sss [-option1] [-option2] [-option3] ....
		example   ./sss -u -n   
		it mean you want to check unowned files (-u) and symbolick link (-n)
	2.	result of scan will appear in file name sss_[date/time that you run program].log in same directory	
	3.	you can use sss program with cron for set to automatic to run 
		by type  
				crontab -e 
		and set to it 
		example     00 00 * * * /root/sss/./sss
		mean  set automatic run on 0:00 o'clock at everyday at every month and every weekday  
		
